Project Title: HR Analytics Dashboard

Description:

Designed an interactive HR Analytics Dashboard to track workforce insights, employee attrition, and satisfaction trends.

Implemented using Power BI / Tableau / Excel (mention tool you used) with dynamic visuals and KPIs.

Key Features:

Attrition Analysis: Segregated attrition by gender, department, education field, and age group.

KPI Metrics: Tracked key stats such as Total Employees (50K), Attrition Count (25,105), Attrition Rate (1.99%), and Average Age (38.97).

Department Insights: Built donut charts to visualize attrition distribution across Hardware, HR, R&D, Sales, Software, and Support.

Demographics: Analyzed employee age groups and their contribution to attrition.

Education Impact: Identified top education fields (Medical, HR, Life Sciences, Marketing, etc.) contributing to attrition.

Job Satisfaction: Displayed employee satisfaction ratings across different job roles.

Travel Analysis: Compared attrition based on Business Travel frequency across departments.

Skills Highlighted:

Data Cleaning & Transformation

Data Visualization & Dashboard Design

KPI Development & HR Analytics

Storytelling with Data

Power BI / Tableau / Excel Expertise

Outcome / Value:

Helped identify critical attrition drivers in the workforce.

Provided actionable insights for HR teams to improve retention strategies.
